{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Legends of Celestite RPG: The All Bearer",
    "steam_appid": 1699950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/333f029d9db2e30d0bb4f2318207884d.avif?t=1751053416\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULL VERSION 1.0</strong> <br><strong>Part 1 of 2: The All Bearer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mana shall shatter and be reborn as drums pound to the rhythm of roses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A crimson darkness envelops the radiant moon above Azmoria, carving an indelible tale into the celestite archives. Fate intertwines two factions, setting the stage for an epic showdown of power. A new saga of heroes must unite to confront their intertwined pasts and a tumultuous present, as an unstoppable supervillain rises from the dead, intent on claiming dominion over all celestites/yokai souls. This is the first part of a two-part, story-driven RPG series inspired by a draft novel by Raven Burns.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Legends of Celestite Part 1: The All Bearer, threads emotional manga storytelling and classic JRPG pastimes into a unique, action-packed world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>TURN-BASED ELEMENTAL COMBAT!</strong></u> - Legends of Celestite RPG combines intense battles with a rich dark fantasy/anime-esque storyline. Each ally who joins the player can fill several roles in combat, such as Tank, DPS, Debuffer, Healer, or Supporter. The battle system also features element-based damage and special aura buffs, adding strategic depth to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ANIMATED ATB BATTLE SYSTEM!</strong></u>- The battle sprites are animated, not static! Fast-paced and punchy ATB System! Unleash combo additions and build your Cross-Skill Meter for more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Collectibles and Secrets</strong></u> await you in Azmoria. Discover Abacus Tokens that help unlock the rarest items/weapons/armours and chests within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>POWER &amp; CONTROL!</u></strong> - Unlock abilities with CP (Celestite Points) and learn/empower your abilities the way you want to.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Adventurer's note:</strong> We strongly recommend playing the game in Window Mode. You can do this by pressing F3 on your keyboard to minimize the screen. You can still use Full-Screen while doing this.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/9a49e6f5cc845619b45173ba860534bf.avif?t=1751053416\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/333f029d9db2e30d0bb4f2318207884d.avif?t=1751053416\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULL VERSION 1.0</strong> <br><strong>Part 1 of 2: The All Bearer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mana shall shatter and be reborn as drums pound to the rhythm of roses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A crimson darkness envelops the radiant moon above Azmoria, carving an indelible tale into the celestite archives. Fate intertwines two factions, setting the stage for an epic showdown of power. A new saga of heroes must unite to confront their intertwined pasts and a tumultuous present, as an unstoppable supervillain rises from the dead, intent on claiming dominion over all celestites/yokai souls. This is the first part of a two-part, story-driven RPG series inspired by a draft novel by Raven Burns.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Legends of Celestite Part 1: The All Bearer, threads emotional manga storytelling and classic JRPG pastimes into a unique, action-packed world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>TURN-BASED ELEMENTAL COMBAT!</strong></u> - Legends of Celestite RPG combines intense battles with a rich dark fantasy/anime-esque storyline. Each ally who joins the player can fill several roles in combat, such as Tank, DPS, Debuffer, Healer, or Supporter. The battle system also features element-based damage and special aura buffs, adding strategic depth to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ANIMATED ATB BATTLE SYSTEM!</strong></u>- The battle sprites are animated, not static! Fast-paced and punchy ATB System! Unleash combo additions and build your Cross-Skill Meter for more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Collectibles and Secrets</strong></u> await you in Azmoria. Discover Abacus Tokens that help unlock the rarest items/weapons/armours and chests within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>POWER &amp; CONTROL!</u></strong> - Unlock abilities with CP (Celestite Points) and learn/empower your abilities the way you want to.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Adventurer's note:</strong> We strongly recommend playing the game in Window Mode. You can do this by pressing F3 on your keyboard to minimize the screen. You can still use Full-Screen while doing this.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/9a49e6f5cc845619b45173ba860534bf.avif?t=1751053416\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
